.venv
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.streamlit/
.gemini/
models/*.pkl
dataset/*.csv
# Note: models and datasets should ideally be tracked with DVC or lfs if they are large, but for this project we'll allow them if needed, or ignore them if we want a clean code repo.
# Actually, the user might want the models and data to be pushed so the app can run immediately on clone. Let's ONLY ignore python cache and gemini data.
!models/*.pkl
!dataset/*.csv
